@startuml Sum_Ssfm_Bsw_Errors_Manager
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_Bsw_Errors_Manager"

**Interfaces Legend**
   //ri121 //: DemCallbackEventUdsStatusChanged 
   //II166 //: Debounced Error
   //II152 //: ERRH_ExecutionStatus
   //II157 //: DisableDTCs
   //II167 //: Undebounced Error
   //II07 //: BUS_OFF_DTC_BswErrorEvent<n>
   //pi135 //: BswError<n>_SetEventStatus
	//II184 //: Sum_Ssfm_Errh_GetDTCsDisabled (Sum_Ssfm_DTCsDisabled)     
endlegend

note top of EC
It is responsible for reading notifications about BSW errors and asking the DEM to set/clear the corresponding DTC accordingly. 
It receives notifications about BSW errors through the GeneralCallbackEventStatusChanged. 
It also notifies the SOH if particular types of bsw errors occur. 
Moreover, it notifies confirmation of CAN BUS OFF dtcs to rest of the application.

end note

component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_Bsw_Errors_Manager] as EC{
	portin ri121
	portout pi135

	[Sum_Ssfm_Bsw_Errors_Manager]  as E
}
   interface II166
   interface II157
   interface II167
   interface II07
   interface II152
   interface II184


  ri121 -> E
  II166 -> E
  II157 -> E
  II152 ->E
  E -> II167 
  E -> II07
  E -> pi135
  II184 -> E

@enduml
